WEBVTT

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:31.871
whether it be emotionally or
professionally or financially,

00:02:32.121 --> 00:02:35.121
that that that it's not a
good place, I think, OK,

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:39.288
my intention is to go there and I make a
plan and I see it on the horizon and

00:02:39.288 --> 00:02:41.579
I think about the steps I need
to take to get there.

00:02:41.996 --> 00:02:43.204
And so on the deepest level,

00:02:43.204 --> 00:02:47.246
planning has been actually an incredibly
healing act for me.

00:02:47.579 --> 00:02:53.413
It's also been just I get pleasure from
knowing the logistics of everything.

00:02:53.663 --> 00:02:59.121
I'm a detail person. I love maybe that
sense of control that I have when

00:02:59.121 --> 00:03:00.954
I look at my calendar, I go, OK,